a8e5-ffcf1b604754|title","text":"hafta, needa, useta"},{"key":"9b9c6914-86f0-4448-91ad-32332b1c44bd|title","text":"coulda, woulda, shoulda"},{"key":"93381b1d-c960-4403-9a28-d6c4d2a93b75|title","text":"dunno, dontcha, whatcha"},{"key":"7b1c6a89-bdad-45bd-9a41-802609c8f2ff|title","text":"outta, offa, cuppa"},{"key":"beaa82ee-d675-44b8-adf8-596c8ca37c5a|title","text":"c'mon, gonna be, s'more"},{"key":"96d3b17b-36da-4b59-a18b-5199dc78c582|title","text":"Redukce v hovorových otázkách"},{"key":"aef0d49a-5252-4ae2-bca1-9a54870c0117|title","text":"Redukce s čísly a časem"},{"key":"294bc66f-885f-487c-a434-e3f668c306c5|title","text":"probably, trying to, supposed to"},{"key":"5b03a85a-0d23-44a4-b9b5-647d6e65d86f|title","text":"let's, gimme that, y'all"},{"key":"1015f614-a8a6-4634-97e1-86252ed3b149|title","text":"Hovorová čísla v rychlé řeči"},{"key":"69aea060-6196-4732-a658-25a6b0d08e52|title","text":"Slova, která v hovorové řeči ztrácejí slabiku"},{"key":"d19575cd-6d8a-4493-b1e0-f3d272543988|title","text":"I'ma a další ultrahovorové tvary"},{"key":"551b9527-f712-421d-966c-24644f360746|title","text":"Další redukce v hovorových pozdravech"},{"key":"b855faed-9428-4a1b-b95c-1e0c3b2d30c8|title","text":"oughta, don't hafta, wantcha"},{"key":"a988c705-5d07-4e9a-a930-5967242b673b|title","text":"Slavná extrémní redukce: 'Did you eat yet?'"},{"key":"e363cee4-e7a6-4107-9da8-a4a5ac3c4a47|title","text":"'because of' a 'sort of a'"},{"key":"d885413e-df2d-4088-b5a9-f07b62449289|title","text":"Hovorové ano/ne: yep, nope, uh-huh"},{"key":"d0dc977b-e24c-46c3-a2a1-6a98544f014f|title","text":"'want a' (věc) a 'want to' (činnost)"},{"key":"6c1b9c14-fcf8-463c-9ba2-34b43d55e77f|title","text":"wouldn't have → wouldn'ta"},{"key":"2856e155-9edf-4a4e-9b05-c66ea6dac7d1|title","text":"just 'cause, gonna need"},{"key":"233cf355-0eca-4443-9a49-65fb7f9946ac|title","text":"ain't — am not, is not, are not"},{"key":"dc20f314-54fe-4dbd-a7f9-1b8af815d3af|title","text":"gotcha — got you"},{"key":"83e44703-96d2-4